1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,132
Every goal starts the same studio argument: why was he free?

2
00:00:04,132 --> 00:00:06,009
The replay shows what happened.

3
00:00:06,009 --> 00:00:07,220
It doesn't show why.

4
00:00:08,669 --> 00:00:11,812
Chance Genesis watches 25 hertz tracking data.

5
00:00:11,812 --> 00:00:21,106
When a shot happens, it traces the previous ten seconds, finds the cause, and has a verified explanation ready before the replay starts.

6
00:00:21,556 --> 00:00:25,574
Here, the striker's run drags his marker fifteen metres wide.

7
00:00:25,574 --> 00:00:28,274
The yellow area is the space that opened.

8
00:00:28,274 --> 00:00:35,980
The dashed circle is where the defender would have been: the receiver would have had 33 square metres instead of 127.

9
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:38,417
And the verdict: he followed his man.

10
00:00:38,417 --> 00:00:41,183
Pulled out by design, not out of position.

11
00:00:41,633 --> 00:00:45,964
For fans at home, the same checked facts become a story about the key player.

12
00:00:48,568 --> 00:00:55,952
This chance looks the same on replay, but the tracking disagrees: the marker stopped for two seconds while his man sprinted.

13
00:00:55,952 --> 00:00:57,976
That's a lost marker, not a decoy.

14
00:01:02,226 --> 00:01:09,906
Here the press closed the defender down from fifteen metres to two, cut his passing lanes, and won the ball 35 metres from goal.

15
00:01:11,106 --> 00:01:13,882
The language model only writes the words.

16
00:01:13,882 --> 00:01:20,448
Every number, time and player comes from code, and a verifier rejects any draft that adds a fact.

17
00:01:20,448 --> 00:01:30,264
On 280 held-out test scenarios, including traps built to fool it, it names the right cause 94 percent of the time, with one percent false alarms.

18
00:01:30,714 --> 00:01:43,556
It's built with Microsoft Agent Framework: a narrator, a fan commentator and a tactical analyst, checked by a verifier with retry and fallback, running on Microsoft Foundry and Azure App Service.

19
00:01:44,006 --> 00:01:44,987
Chance Genesis.

20
00:01:44,987 --> 00:01:47,078
The why, before the replay ends.

